Smart Traffic Management System

Project Overview

The Smart Traffic Management System is a web-based application developed to monitor, analyze, and manage traffic flow within urban and rural areas. The system enables traffic authorities and administrators to track vehicle movements, monitor congestion levels, and optimize traffic signals in real time.

This project improves road safety, reduces traffic congestion, and provides a centralized platform for efficient traffic management.

---

Problem Statement

Traditional traffic management systems often rely on manual monitoring and fixed traffic signal timings, which can lead to traffic congestion, increased travel time, accidents, and inefficient road utilization. Cities require an intelligent and automated system to manage traffic flow and support smart transportation initiatives.

The Smart Traffic Management System addresses these challenges by providing an intelligent and user-friendly traffic monitoring and control solution.

